spec: specs/intent-classify.md — the temporal slot (a PERIOD beside a day) and the amount slot (the «зл» abbreviation)

why: okay-chat measured its slot layer against token vectors over 317 live
  turns (its specs/meaning.md). Two of the three real misses were vocabulary
  here: «чиню гусли за 90 зл» carried a price `Amount` did not read, and six
  what's-on questions said «на этой неделе» / «на выходных», which `Temporal`
  refuses on purpose because a week is not a day. It is an interval, and an
  interval is not a guess.
